      <slug></slug>
      <title>ScalableOGo</title>
      <subtitle></subtitle>
      <track>GNUstep + OpenGroupware + Etoile</track>
      <type></type>
      <language></language>
      <abstract>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;This presentation presents ScalableOGo, a standards compliant free software groupware server.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;  </abstract>
      <description>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Scalable OGo (SOGo) is a free groupware server focused on scalability instead of depth in functionality. The web interface uses human readable URLs and can be accessed according to REST web service ideas.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;The server stores data in the iCalendar/vCard formats and has broad support for theCalDAV/GroupDAV protocols.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;  </description>
      <persons>
          <person id="1091">Helge Heß</person>
      </persons>
